@startuml login-flow

actor User
participant "LoginScreen" as Screen
participant "fetchUtils" as Fetch
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthServiceImpl" as Service
participant "AuthenticationManager" as AuthMgr
participant "JwtUtility" as Jwt
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
database MySQL

User -> Screen: Indtaster email og password
Screen -> Fetch: POST /api/auth/login
Fetch -> Controller: HTTP request
Controller -> Service: login(LoginRequestDto)

Service -> AuthMgr: authenticate(email, password)
Service -> Repo: findByEmail(email)
Repo -> MySQL: SELECT * FROM user WHERE email=?
MySQL --> Repo: user data
Repo --> AuthMgr: User

alt Authentication successful
    AuthMgr --> Service: Authentication

    Service -> Jwt: generateToken(userId)
    Jwt --> Service: jwtToken

    Service --> Controller: AuthResponseDto(token, email, id)
    Controller --> Fetch: 200 OK + AuthResponseDto
    Fetch --> Screen: response

    Screen -> Screen: Gem token i AsyncStorage
    Screen --> User: Naviger til Home

else Authentication failed
    AuthMgr --> Service: AuthenticationException

    Service --> Controller: UnauthorizedException
    Controller --> Fetch: 401 Unauthorized
    Fetch --> Screen: Error response

    Screen --> User: Vis fejlmeddelelse\n("Forkert email eller password")
end

@enduml